@startuml

title Password Security Analyzer - State Diagram

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state "Password Entered" as PasswordEntered
state "Analyzing Password" as Analyzing
state "Score Calculated" as ScoreCalculated
state "Common Password Check" as CommonCheck
state "Strength Determined" as StrengthDetermined
state "Result Generated" as ResultGenerated
state "Results Displayed" as ResultsDisplayed

Idle --> PasswordEntered : User enters password

PasswordEntered --> Analyzing : Analysis begins

Analyzing --> ScoreCalculated : Security checks completed

ScoreCalculated --> CommonCheck : Check password

CommonCheck --> StrengthDetermined : Common password\n[Strength = Weak]

CommonCheck --> StrengthDetermined : Not common\n[Determine from score]

StrengthDetermined --> ResultGenerated : Generate feedback,\nrisk indicators & recommendation

ResultGenerated --> ResultsDisplayed : Display analysis

ResultsDisplayed --> [*]

@enduml